    "title": {
      "rendered": "E-Recycling Aug. 11th, 2022!"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3369\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-683x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"443\" height=\"664\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-200x300.jpg 200w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-768x1151.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-1025x1536.jpg 1025w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-1366x2048.jpg 1366w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Recycling-and-giving-back-scaled.jpg 1708w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 443px) 100vw, 443px\" /></p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://sydneysweeneyonlyfans.blog/\" target=\"_blank\">Sydney Sweeney leaked videos</a></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: #333333\">Donors and Supporters we&#8217;re HAPPY to announce that this year&#8217;s the E-Recycling Event was held at the PCC Campus outdoor square and parking lot on <span style=\"color: #3366ff\"><strong>2305 SE 82nd and Division in Portland, OR 97216</strong></span> on August 11th and we received over 106 laptops, cellphones and tablets to inspect and refurbish!! Checkout the event video  below:</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/18etapEVH3Y\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3366\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/you-tube.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/you-tube.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/you-tube-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><a href=\"https://anandi.com/jazz-vocalist\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%\">https://anandi.com/jazz-vocalist</span></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20.16px;color: #333333\">We very much appreciate this Portland Community College&#8217;s interest and support in the Annual E-Recycling PDX event this year.  The activities, live music, Poblano Peppers, drive-thru donation areas and more interactive activities with the Speakers and Key Donors made it a fun and successful one!</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>If you&#8217;d like to continue donating thru the year</strong> &#8211; Below is our QR Codes, both Paypal and Venmo for  donations. Thank you! Please remember an average refurbish item costs $30-$40 in supplies and new cords.  The $5.00 coffee you skip and send us helps us get these electronics refurbished and given back out to the local non-profits <a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\">New Avenues for Youth</a>, <a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\">Blanchet House</a>, <a href=\"https://www.raphaelhouse.org/\">Raphael House</a> and <a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rosehaven.</a><strong>  Thank you!</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3163\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/venmo-ERecyclingpdx.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"423\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/venmo-ERecyclingpdx.jpg 423w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/venmo-ERecyclingpdx-198x300.jpg 198w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 423px) 100vw, 423px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3159 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"209\" height=\"209\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling.png 320w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling-300x300.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/QR-Code-for-E-Recycling-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 209px) 100vw, 209px\" /></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<h3>Please feel free to reach out to<span style=\"background-color: #3366ff;color: #ffffff\"><a style=\"background-color: #3366ff;color: #ffffff\" href=\"mailto:Michelle@GetLagosNow.com\">Michelle@GetLagosNow.com</a>, </span>as we&#8217;re new accepting new Supporters and look forward to learning more about you and your business/organization.</h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span style=\"color: #808080\">2022 Donations</span></strong></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://www.raphaelhouse.org/\">Raphael House</a> received two HP laptops</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\">New Avenues for Youth</a> received two dell laptops and 1 HP All-in-one desktop computer</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\">Rosehaven</a> received 2 laptops and 2 HP All-in-one desktop computers</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\">Blanchet House</a> received a 11 HP, Dell and Mac Computers!!!</h3>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3328 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Blanchet-house-donation-7.2022-751x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"447\" height=\"609\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Blanchet-house-donation-7.2022-751x1024.png 751w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Blanchet-house-donation-7.2022-220x300.png 220w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Blanchet-house-donation-7.2022-768x1047.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Blanchet-house-donation-7.2022.png 1091w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 447px) 100vw, 447px\" /></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3295 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/donating-to-blanchet-house-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/donating-to-blanchet-house-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/donating-to-blanchet-house-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/donating-to-blanchet-house-768x576.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/donating-to-blanchet-house-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/donating-to-blanchet-house.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3456\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-9.2022-Donation.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-9.2022-Donation.jpeg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-9.2022-Donation-300x225.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3479\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/gary-and-Michelle-donate-at-Blanchet-11.9-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"629\" height=\"472\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/gary-and-Michelle-donate-at-Blanchet-11.9-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/gary-and-Michelle-donate-at-Blanchet-11.9-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/gary-and-Michelle-donate-at-Blanchet-11.9-768x576.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/gary-and-Michelle-donate-at-Blanchet-11.9-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/gary-and-Michelle-donate-at-Blanchet-11.9.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 629px) 100vw, 629px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3457\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural-300x225.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3483\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Rose-haven-pic-with-Liz-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"609\" height=\"457\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Rose-haven-pic-with-Liz-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Rose-haven-pic-with-Liz-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Rose-haven-pic-with-Liz-768x576.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Rose-haven-pic-with-Liz-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Rose-haven-pic-with-Liz.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 609px) 100vw, 609px\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-3482\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/gary-works-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"699\" height=\"524\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/gary-works-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/gary-works-300x225.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/gary-works-768x576.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/gary-works-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/gary-works.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 699px) 100vw, 699px\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3463 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/gary-donates-999x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"670\" height=\"686\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/gary-donates-999x1024.jpg 999w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/gary-donates-293x300.jpg 293w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/gary-donates-768x787.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/gary-donates.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px\" /></p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3296\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/new-avenues-12.21-rotated.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/new-avenues-12.21-rotated.jpg 480w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/new-avenues-12.21-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px\" /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3298 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Michelle-donates-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"661\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Michelle-donates-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Michelle-donates-225x300.jpg 225w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Michelle-donates-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Michelle-donates.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 496px) 100vw, 496px\" /></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
